#: lib/ask_drive_web/live/acme_panel.ex:188
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Get a certificate from Let's Encrypt and restart HTTPS to apply it. A temporary TXT record is added to DNS and deleted after the check. Continue?"
msgstr "Let's Encrypt から証明書を取得し、HTTPS を再起動して適用します。DNS に一時的な TXT レコードを追加し、確認後に削除します。続行しますか？"

#: lib/ask_drive_web/live/acme_panel.ex:149
